From mtmorgan at fhcrc.org  Sat Apr 10 01:22:53 2010
From: mtmorgan at fhcrc.org (Martin Morgan)
Date: Fri, 09 Apr 2010 16:22:53 -0700
Subject: [BioC] snow library, question on clusterExport
