Francesco,
First three points:

1.) Please do not post general questions about R functionality (e.g. proper use of install.packages) to the BioC mailing list. If everybody followed suit, the general R questions would drown out the BioC specific questions.

2.) Hmisc is not a BioC package.

3.) Your subject heading is not descriptive enough, nor does it match the body of your message (Hmisc 3.7.0 vs Hmisc 3.6-1)


To answer your question, you need to specify type = "source" when installing a source package.

install.packages("Hmisc_3.6-1.tar.gz", repos = NULL, type = "source")



Cheers,
Patrick



